read FemMesh.inp
view elem
rot y
rot u 20
rot r 20
frame
plot f all g
hcpy png
plot f all w
plus n BoltFix r
plus n +clo b
frame
hcpy png
seta top n +clo
comp top up
comp top do
plot f top g
plus n +clo r
frame
hcpy png
rot z
frame
hcpy png
seta bolt n BoltFix
comp bolt up
comp bolt do
rot y
rot u 20
rot r 20
plot f bolt g
plus n BoltFix r
frame
hcpy png
quit
